#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut22_player
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  520
#! poster  228
#! crop    0 0 1100 680
#! keys
# F5 runs the plate, writing a snapshot every 4 iterations; the Result panel shows the converged field and the player
# of the run's snapshots. Play: the field steps through iterations 4 to 112 and the converged one, again and again;
# pause, then back one snapshot twice. The legend is dragged down (the range moves up) and zoomed with the wheel: the
# field is coloured again; Reset range
0   move 600 300
10  key f5
200 move 399 85 12
215 down
216 up
305 down
306 up
320 move 370 85 8
330 down
331 up
345 down
346 up
375 move 797 250 12
390 down
391 move 797 205 20
415 up
435 wheel 0 2
445 wheel 0 2
470 move 871 61 12
485 down
486 up
500 move 600 300 15
